# Algorithm Directory Management Guide

## Algorithm Directory Structure

The blog includes a dedicated [algorithms index page](mdc:source/algorithms/index.md) that organizes algorithm knowledge and problem-solving records.

## Updating the Algorithm Directory

After creating a new algorithm post, you MUST update the [algorithms directory page](mdc:source/algorithms/index.md):

1. Find the appropriate section based on algorithm type (e.g., 动态规划, 深度优先搜索, etc.)
2. Create a new section if needed for the algorithm type
3. Add a link to your new post:
```markdown
- [[Problem ID] Problem Title](/path/to/post) - Brief description
```

4. Maintain chronological order (newest posts at the top)
5. For posts with the "❌错题集" tag, add a "❌" prefix to the link description

The algorithm directory is available at: https://adrianwangs.github.io/algorithms/